I remember the one time I was successful in robbing a shop was when I had
really searched out this level.  I knew where verything was and then I
found the shop.  It was a scroll shop.  So I figured maybe I can find and
identify and figure out what some of this stuff is, or just find out
looking for the identify.  Well I was just a new player at the time and I
didn't quite know what happens to people that teleport out of the shop
without paying.  That is what I did.  The shop keeper found me and asked me
to pay, but by then I had eaten a leprechaun, and was teleporting at
random.  One of the teleports put me quite close to the stairs down and
since I knew that things don't follow you from one level to the next, I
went down.  (Only time they follow is if they are right next to you)  When
I ran from something back up a level the shopkeeper was right there.  If I
had chosen some other escape I would have gotten away scot free.

Crime Pays--- ;} 




